"avec sa date et son heure d'envoi."
msgstr ""
"Preview: the consumer's full declaration appears here, together with its "
"date and time of submission."

#: includes/Eligibility.php:220
msgid ""
"Le statut actuel de cette commande ne permet pas de déposer une déclaration "
"de rétractation en ligne."
msgstr ""
"The current status of this order does not allow an online withdrawal "
"declaration."

#: includes/Eligibility.php:224
msgid ""
"Aucun article de cette commande n'ouvre droit à rétractation, ou une "
"déclaration a déjà été déposée pour la totalité des articles."
msgstr ""
"No item in this order carries a right of withdrawal, or a declaration has "
"already been submitted for every item."

#. translators: %s : date limite.
#: includes/Eligibility.php:230
#, php-format
msgid "Le délai de rétractation de cette commande a expiré le %s."
msgstr "The withdrawal period for this order expired on %s."

#: includes/Emails/Acknowledgement.php:36
msgid "Rétractation — accusé de réception"
msgstr "Withdrawal — acknowledgement of receipt"

#: includes/Emails/Acknowledgement.php:37
msgid ""
"Envoyé au consommateur immédiatement après le dépôt de sa déclaration de "
"rétractation. Cet e-mail constitue l'accusé de réception sur support durable "
"exigé par la réglementation : il est fortement déconseillé de le désactiver."
msgstr ""
"Sent to the consumer immediately after their withdrawal declaration is "
"submitted. This email is the acknowledgement of receipt on a durable medium "
"required by law: disabling it is strongly discouraged."

#: includes/Emails/Acknowledgement.php:56
msgid "Accusé de réception de votre rétractation ({reference})"
msgstr "Acknowledgement of your withdrawal ({reference})"

#: includes/Emails/Acknowledgement.php:65
msgid "Votre rétractation a bien été reçue"
msgstr "Your withdrawal has been received"

#: includes/Emails/MerchantNotification.php:33
msgid "Rétractation — notification interne"
msgstr "Withdrawal — internal notification"

#: includes/Emails/MerchantNotification.php:34
msgid ""
"Prévient la boutique qu'une déclaration de rétractation vient d'être déposée."
msgstr ""
"Notifies the shop that a withdrawal declaration has just been submitted."

#: includes/Emails/MerchantNotification.php:53
msgid "[{site_title}] Rétractation reçue — commande #{order_number}"
msgstr "[{site_title}] Withdrawal received — order #{order_number}"

#: includes/Emails/MerchantNotification.php:62
msgid "Nouvelle déclaration de rétractation"
msgstr "New withdrawal declaration"

#: includes/Emails/MerchantNotification.php:125
