#: includes/Settings.php:45
msgid "Page de rétractation"
msgstr "Withdrawal page"

#: includes/Settings.php:46
msgid ""
"Page contenant le code court [retractation]. Créée automatiquement à "
"l'activation."
msgstr ""
"Page containing the [retractation] shortcode. Created automatically on "
"activation."

#: includes/Settings.php:52
msgid "Libellé du bouton"
msgstr "Button label"

#: includes/Settings.php:53
msgid ""
"Doit être une formule dénuée d'ambiguïté (art. D.221-5). Formulations "
"sûres : « Renoncer au contrat ici », « Se rétracter du contrat ici », "
"« Exercer mon droit de rétractation »."
msgstr ""
"Must be unambiguous wording (Art. D.221-5). Safe wordings: “Withdraw from "
"the contract here”, “Exercise my right of withdrawal”."

#: includes/Settings.php:59
msgid "Libellé du bouton de confirmation"
msgstr "Confirmation button label"

#: includes/Settings.php:60
msgid ""
"Second bouton, exigé par l'article 11 bis de la directive (UE) 2011/83 "
"modifiée."
msgstr ""
"Second button, required by Article 11a of Directive (EU) 2011/83 as amended."

#: includes/Settings.php:66
msgid "Texte d'introduction"
msgstr "Introduction text"

#: includes/Settings.php:67
msgid "Affiché en haut de la page de rétractation."
msgstr "Displayed at the top of the withdrawal page."

#: includes/Settings.php:73
msgid "Mention légale"
msgstr "Legal notice"

#: includes/Settings.php:74
msgid "Affichée sous le formulaire. Laisser vide pour ne rien afficher."
msgstr "Displayed below the form. Leave empty to display nothing."

#: includes/Settings.php:82
msgid "Liste des commandes (Mon compte)"
msgstr "Order list (My account)"

#: includes/Settings.php:83
msgid "Ajoute le bouton en face de chaque commande éligible."
msgstr "Adds the button next to each eligible order."

#: includes/Settings.php:89
msgid "Détail d'une commande (Mon compte)"
msgstr "Order details (My account)"

#: includes/Settings.php:90
msgid "Ajoute le bouton sous le détail de la commande."
msgstr "Adds the button below the order details."

#: includes/Settings.php:96
msgid "Lien permanent en pied de page"
msgstr "Permanent link in the footer"

#: includes/Settings.php:97
msgid ""
"Recommandé : la fonction doit être « disponible en permanence » et "
"« aisément accessible » pendant tout le délai de rétractation."
msgstr ""
"Recommended: the function must be “permanently available” and “easily "
"accessible” throughout the withdrawal period."

#: includes/Settings.php:103
msgid "Lien dans les e-mails WooCommerce"
msgstr "Link in WooCommerce emails"

#: includes/Settings.php:104
msgid "Ajoute le lien vers la page de rétractation au bas des e-mails client."
msgstr "Adds the link to the withdrawal page at the bottom of customer emails."

#: includes/Settings.php:110
msgid "Couleur de fond du bouton"
msgstr "Button background colour"

#: includes/Settings.php:116
msgid "Couleur du texte du bouton"
msgstr "Button text colour"

#: includes/Settings.php:122
msgid "Charger la feuille de style du plugin"
msgstr "Load the plugin stylesheet"

#: includes/Settings.php:123
msgid "Décocher pour styler entièrement depuis le thème."
msgstr "Uncheck to style everything from the theme."

#: includes/Settings.php:133
msgid "Délai de rétractation (jours)"
msgstr "Withdrawal period (days)"

#: includes/Settings.php:134
msgid "Minimum légal : 14 jours. Vous pouvez offrir davantage."
msgstr "Legal minimum: 14 days. You may offer more."

#: includes/Settings.php:144
msgid "Point de départ du délai"
msgstr "Start of the period"

#: includes/Settings.php:145
msgid ""
"Pour les biens, le délai court à compter de la réception. Le statut "
"« Terminée » en est l'approximation la plus fidèle ; à défaut, la date de "
"commande est utilisée."
msgstr ""
"For goods, the period runs from delivery. The “Completed” status is the "
"closest approximation; failing that, the order date is used."

#: includes/Settings.php:153
msgid "Jours de tolérance supplémentaires"
msgstr "Extra grace days"

#: includes/Settings.php:154
msgid ""
"Marge appliquée après le délai, pour absorber les écarts entre la date de "
"livraison réelle et le statut de la commande."
msgstr ""
"Margin applied after the deadline, to absorb the gap between actual delivery "
"and order status."

#: includes/Settings.php:160
msgid "Statuts de commande concernés"
msgstr "Order statuses concerned"

#: includes/Settings.php:161
msgid "Seules les commandes dans ces statuts affichent le bouton."
msgstr "Only orders in these statuses display the button."

#: includes/Settings.php:167
msgid "Refuser les demandes hors délai"
msgstr "Refuse late requests"

#: includes/Settings.php:168
msgid ""
"Déconseillé. Par défaut, une demande hors délai est enregistrée et signalée "
"comme telle : c'est vous qui tranchez, et vous conservez la preuve de la "
"demande."
msgstr ""
"Not recommended. By default a late request is recorded and flagged as such: "
"you decide, and you keep proof of the request."

#: includes/Settings.php:174
msgid "Exclure les produits virtuels ou téléchargeables"
msgstr "Exclude virtual or downloadable products"

#: includes/Settings.php:175
msgid ""
"À n'activer que si le consommateur a expressément renoncé à son droit avant "
"l'exécution (art. L.221-28 13°)."
msgstr ""
"Only enable this if the consumer expressly waived their right before "
"performance (Art. L.221-28 13°)."

#: includes/Settings.php:181
msgid "Produits exclus"
msgstr "Excluded products"

#: includes/Settings.php:182
msgid "Identifiants de produits séparés par des virgules."
msgstr "Comma-separated product IDs."

#: includes/Settings.php:188
msgid "Catégories exclues"
msgstr "Excluded categories"

#: includes/Settings.php:189
msgid "Identifiants de catégories de produits séparés par des virgules."
msgstr "Comma-separated product category IDs."

#: includes/Settings.php:195
msgid "Proposer un motif (facultatif)"
msgstr "Offer a reason (optional)"

#: includes/Settings.php:196
msgid ""
"Le motif ne peut jamais être rendu obligatoire : le droit de rétractation "
"s'exerce sans justification."
msgstr ""
"The reason can never be made mandatory: the right of withdrawal is exercised "
"without justification."

#: includes/Settings.php:204
msgid "Changer le statut de la commande"
msgstr "Change the order status"

#: includes/Settings.php:205
msgid ""
"Bascule la commande vers « Rétractation demandée » lorsque la déclaration "
"porte sur la totalité de la commande."
msgstr ""
"Moves the order to “Withdrawal requested” when the declaration covers the "
"whole order."

#: includes/Settings.php:211
msgid "Destinataire des notifications"
msgstr "Notification recipients"

#: includes/Settings.php:212
msgid ""
"Adresses séparées par des virgules. Vide = adresse d'administration du site."
msgstr "Comma-separated addresses. Empty = the site administration address."

#: includes/Settings.php:218
msgid "Conserver l'adresse IP du déclarant"
msgstr "Store the declarant's IP address"

